estion-number\">27</strong> Why does Harry want to do the presentation?</span><div class=\"source-option\"><label class=\"source-option-letter\">A</label><span data-luma-question=\"en-official-materials-t1-l-q27\" data-luma-kind=\"radio\" data-luma-option=\"A\"></span><span>to practise skills for his future career</span></div><div class=\"source-option\"><label class=\"source-option-letter\">B</label><span data-luma-question=\"en-official-materials-t1-l-q27\" data-luma-kind=\"radio\" data-luma-option=\"B\"></span><span>to catch up with his course requirements</span></div><div class=\"source-option\"><label class=\"source-option-letter\">C</label><span data-luma-question=\"en-official-materials-t1-l-q27\" data-luma-kind=\"radio\" data-luma-option=\"C\"></span><span>to get a better mark than for his last presentation</span></div></div><div class=\"source-question-item\"><span><strong class=\"source-question-number\">28</strong> What is Katy's attitude to writing up the project?</span><div class=\"source-option\"><label class=\"source-option-letter\">A</label><span data-luma-question=\"en-official-materials-t1-l-q28\" data-luma-kind=\"radio\" data-luma-option=\"A\"></span><span>She is worried about the time available for writing.</span></div><div class=\"source-option\"><label class=\"source-option-letter\">B</label><span data-luma-question=\"en-official-materials-t1-l-q28\" data-luma-kind=\"radio\" data-luma-option=\"B\"></span><span>She thinks it is unfair if she has to do all the writing.</span></div><div class=\"source-option\"><label class=\"source-option-letter\">C</label><span data-luma-question=\"en-official-materials-t1-l-q28\" data-luma-kind=\"radio\" data-luma-option=\"C\"></span><span>She is concerned that some parts will be difficult.</span></div></div><div class=\"source-question-item\"><span><strong class=\"source-question-number\">29</strong> Why does Harry want to involve the other students at the end of the presentation?</span><div class=\"source-opti